      clinicalImportance: 'The anesthesia machine is the cornerstone of the operating room, enabling safe general anesthesia for millions of surgical procedures annually. It maintains unconsciousness, analgesia, and muscle relaxation while ensuring adequate oxygenation and ventilation. Failures can be rapidly fatal, making understanding of its function and safety systems essential for anesthesiologists.',
